This product may dynamically invoke a local FFmpeg binary for hardware
capture and encode. FFmpeg is a separate program, typically licensed
under LGPL/GPL depending on the build. The gyan.dev essentials build
commonly used on Windows is GPL. Redistribute FFmpeg only under its
own license terms.

This product may use Cisco OpenH264 as a software encode/decode
fallback. OpenH264 is subject to the Cisco OpenH264 license:
https://www.openh264.org/BINARY_LICENSE.txt

ViGEmBus (optional, for virtual Xbox 360 gamepads on the Windows host)
is a separate driver by Nefarius, MIT licensed.
https://github.com/nefarius/ViGEmBus
